For the purposes of this license:

"Orion Engine" means the software, source code, compiled binaries, tools, libraries, engine systems, rendering systems, editor functionality, shaders, and other original software components created and distributed by Md Rayhan Goni Farhan under the name "Orion Engine."

"Creator" means Md Rayhan Goni Farhan.

"User" means any person or organization that obtains, uses, copies, or distributes Orion Engine in accordance with this license.

"User Content" means any creative work produced, imported, edited, rendered, simulated, or otherwise created by a User using Orion Engine. This includes, but is not limited to, games, applications, 3D models, textures, materials, animations, scenes, scripts, audio, music, images, videos, artwork, characters, stories, and other creative works.

## 2. Free Use

Orion Engine is provided completely free of charge.

No purchase, subscription, royalty, licensing fee, or other payment to the Creator is required to use Orion Engine.

You may use Orion Engine for personal, educational, research, artistic, professional, and commercial purposes.

You may use Orion Engine to create and distribute games, applications, 3D artwork, animations, simulations, visualizations, renders, interactive experiences, and other works for any lawful purpose.

You may sell, publish, monetize, or otherwise commercially distribute User Content created using Orion Engine without owing the Creator any payment or royalty.

## 3. Ownership of User Content

The Creator claims no ownership over User Content created by Users.

You retain ownership of your own original creative work, subject to any rights belonging to other parties whose material you use.

Using Orion Engine does not transfer ownership of your games, applications, models, artwork, animations, textures, audio, music, scripts, scenes, or other original creative works to the Creator.

The Creator does not claim ownership of third-party creative works merely because they are created, edited, rendered, imported, or processed using Orion Engine.

Users remain responsible for ensuring that they have the necessary rights and permissions for any third-party material they use.

## 4. Attribution to Orion Engine

When Orion Engine is used to create or distribute a game, application, artwork, animation, rendering, simulation, or other publicly released work, reasonable credit must be given to Orion Engine.

The credit must identify the software as:

"Orion Engine"

and must identify its creator as:

"Created by Md Rayhan Goni Farhan"

The attribution may appear in a credits screen, about page, documentation, website, project page, or another reasonable location appropriate to the type of work.

The required attribution does not give the Creator ownership of the User's work.

