The original copyright notices, author information, license notices, and attribution information included with Orion Engine must not be removed, obscured, falsified, or replaced.

The name "Md Rayhan Goni Farhan" must remain associated with Orion Engine.

The name "Orion Engine" must not be removed from the software, its documentation, or its official attribution information in a way that falsely represents the origin of the software.

Users may not claim that Orion Engine was created by another person or organization.

